a wood scent; (2) participants always watch alone online, so the paper's social (pairs) viewing condition is not included; (3) the Likert anchor labels are ours (the paper gives only '5-point Likert scales'); (4) the paper lists 8 presence items but prints 6, and only the 6 printed items are used; English items only (the paper also used a Dutch translation); (5) the paper's manipulation checks are not described in enough detail to copy and are left out; demographic wording is ours.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"scenes\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"start\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"consent\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part. Participation is voluntary and my answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"assignment\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"nature_type\",\n      \"title\": \"Assigned type of nature\",\n      \"description\": \"Set at random by the page.\",\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"wild\",\n        \"text\": \"Wild nature\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"tended\",\n        \"text\": \"Tended nature\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"scene_order\",\n      \"title\": \"Order of appearance\",\n      \"description\": \"Set at random by the page.\",\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"dense_first\",\n        \"text\": \"Dense, then spacious\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"spacious_first\",\n        \"text\": \"Spacious, then dense\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"scene\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"matrix\",\n      \"name\": \"social\",\n      \"title\": \"Social aspirations\",\n      